{
  "file" : "npc/instances/EndlessTower.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^008800Wait here!!",
      "translation" : "^008800請稍候！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're carrying too much stuff. Why don't you put some of it away, and then come back.^000000",
      "translation" : "你攜帶的東西太多了。先收起一部分，再回來吧。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sigh... I don't know if I can ever go back to sailing the sea...",
      "translation" : "唉...我不知道自己還能不能再回到海上航行..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffLooking incredibly excited, the old man ran into the marine shop hurriedly ordering goods. You don't have anything better to do, so you decide to ask him why he is in such a rush.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老人看起來興奮不已，急匆匆地跑進船具店訂購物資。你正好沒什麼事，便決定問問他為何如此匆忙。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe old man, after finishing his orders, walks towards you.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老人訂購完物資後，朝你走來。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was touched when you accepted a request from me, a stranger, so easily. You must truly be one of those good, heroic adventurers. Are you interested in setting out on an ocean voyage?",
      "translation" : "一個陌生人提出請求，你卻這麼爽快地答應了，我很感動。你一定是那種善良又勇敢的冒險者。想不想出海航行？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've sailed a few times... But now that I think about it, I've never gone across the continent.",
      "translation" : "我出過幾次海...不過現在想想，我還從沒橫渡過大陸之外的海洋。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, that's good enough. I may just have one small fishing vessel, but I used to be a captain that commanded a fleet.",
      "translation" : "那就足夠了。我雖然只有一艘小小的漁船，但以前可是統領艦隊的船長。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As you may know after a few sea voyages, not many people have gone across the ocean beyond the continent. I too have failed to conquer the ocean.",
      "translation" : "你出海幾次後應該也知道，橫渡大陸之外海洋的人寥寥無幾。我也沒能征服那片海洋。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffMr. Janssen talked about his perilous ocean journeys for quite a while. You have enough time on your hands, so you sit down, quietly listening to his story.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff詹森先生講述了許久危險的航海經歷。你時間充裕，便坐下來靜靜聽他講述。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffAt least half of his story sounded grossly exaggerated, but something caught your ear: he insists that a humongous tower exists on the ocean, and that it's so tall, it scrapes across the sky.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff他的故事至少有一半聽起來誇張得離譜，不過有件事引起了你的注意：他堅稱海上有一座巨塔，高聳入雲，直插天際。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So all I could do was cast anchor at that humongous tower after my fleet was wrecked. At first, we were only going to stay there until the rainstorm was over, but it didn't end as soon as we had hoped.",
      "translation" : "艦隊遇難後，我只能在那座巨塔旁拋錨。起初我們打算等暴風雨過去就離開，可雨遲遲沒有停。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My crew was starving, and a few of them walked into the tower in order to find food... They never came back.",
      "translation" : "船員們餓壞了，有幾個人走進塔裡尋找食物...他們再也沒有回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why didn't you go in there with them?",
      "translation" : "你為什麼不和他們一起進去？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My instincts told me that tower was dangerous. I was curious, but I wasn't going to risk my life. We waited for them to come back for 7 days until the rainstorm was finally over, but no one returned.",
      "translation" : "我的直覺告訴我那座塔很危險。雖然我很好奇，但不想拿性命冒險。我們等了七天，暴風雨終於停了，可他們始終沒有回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In our desperation to survive, we abandoned all our goods, and left the tower only with a little bit of the water and edible plants we'd found around the tower. When we finally reached land, I was the only one alive...",
      "translation" : "為了活下去，我們只能放棄所有物資，只帶上少量水和在塔附近找到的可食用植物。終於抵達陸地時，只有我一個人活了下來..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffYou could imagine the heartwretching scene of the dying fleet on their last voyage, even if he didn't explain it any further. A look of somber regret swept over his face as he remained silent a while, and then he said:^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff即使他沒有繼續說明，你也能想像那支艦隊在最後一次航行中走向毀滅的悲慘景象。他沉默片刻，臉上掠過深深的悔恨，隨後說道：^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have something I must do before I die. I must retrieve the remains of my crew that died in the tower, and give them a proper burial.",
      "translation" : "我死前還有一件必須完成的事。我得找回死在塔裡的船員遺骸，為他們好好安葬。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I feel so lucky to meet a warm-hearted adventurer like you. With the money you've given me, I can finally go sailing to the tower again.",
      "translation" : "能遇見你這樣熱心的冒險者，我真是太幸運了。有了你給我的錢，我終於能再次乘船前往那座塔。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How about hiring me as your first mate?",
      "translation" : "僱我當你的大副怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you, but it is an extremely dangerous place. I have my duty to fulfill, but you don't have any obligation to me or them. I don't wish to sacrifice someone as young as you to such a dangerous place.",
      "translation" : "謝謝你，但那裡極其危險。我有必須完成的責任，可你對我和他們都沒有任何義務。我不想讓你這麼年輕就葬身在那種危險的地方。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No...",
      "translation" : "不..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : ".",
      "translation" : "。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : ".",
      "translation" : "。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As an adventurer, there's my obligation to those in need. I'm also very curious about that place...",
      "translation" : "作為冒險者，我有責任幫助有困難的人。而且我也很好奇那個地方..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was going to leave right away, but since you've joined me, I should give you time to prepare. I'll be waiting here until you're ready to go.",
      "translation" : "我本打算立刻出發，不過既然你要和我一起去，我應該給你時間準備。準備好之前，我會一直在這裡等你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...Okay then...",
      "translation" : "...那好吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome aboard, first mate.",
      "translation" : "歡迎上船，大副。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Shall we leave now?",
      "translation" : "我們現在出發嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, let's go!",
      "translation" : "好，走吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, I'm not quite ready...",
      "translation" : "不，我還沒準備好..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then pull up the anchor, first mate!",
      "translation" : "那就起錨吧，大副！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure, no problem. Come back when you're ready.",
      "translation" : "當然沒問題。準備好之後再來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, to travel the ocean again, we need to restock on goods. If you give me 10,000 Zeny, I'll take care of the rest.",
      "translation" : "要再次出海，我們得補充物資。你給我10,000 ZENY，剩下的交給我處理。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll come back later.",
      "translation" : "我晚點再來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's go, now!",
      "translation" : "現在就出發！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but I don't have that much money. I'll come back when I save enough.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我沒那麼多錢。等我存夠了再回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure, no problem. I'll be waiting for your return.",
      "translation" : "當然沒問題。我會等你回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you don't have enough money. I need at least 10,000 Zeny to restock our supplies...",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你的錢不夠。補充物資至少需要10,000 ZENY..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excellent! Now we're good to go. Let's pull up the anchor again!",
      "translation" : "太好了！現在可以出發了。再起錨吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excuse me, are you an adventurer?",
      "translation" : "打擾一下，你是冒險者嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry to ask you this, especially when this is the first time we've ever met, but can you do me a favor? I'll make it short.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我們才剛認識就提出請求，不過能幫我一個忙嗎？我長話短說。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船長]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you donate ^0000ff10,000 Zeny^000000 to me? It's for a cause that's important to me...",
      "translation" : "可以捐給我^0000ff10,000 ZENY^000000嗎？這筆錢對我有很重要的用途..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No!",
      "translation" : "不行！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure thing.",
      "translation" : "當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you've got the wrong person to ask that.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你問錯人了。"
